Passed · Signed" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 border rounded-[2px] font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide leading-none whitespace-nowrap bg-[#F0FDF4] text-[#14532D] border-[#BBF7D0] "><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-[1px] shrink-0 bg-[#14532D]" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>PASSED</span></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Senate</span></div><span class="tabular-nums font-medium text-[#181715] shrink-0">IDX 57.0</span></div><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-[#181715] mt-1 leading-snug">Relating to funding mechanisms to support the construction, maintenance, modernization, and operation of electric generating facilities (Powering Texas Forward Act).</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#57534E] mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed">Created the $5 billion Texas Energy Fund offering low-interest loans and completion bonuses for dispatchable natural gas power plants inside ERCOT.</p><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[11px] text-[#78716C] font-mono tabular-nums"><span>Author: Schwertner</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>0 versions</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>2 linked</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>2023-06-09</span></div></button><button type="button" class="w-full p-4 text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer block hover:bg-[#FBF9F5]"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#57534E]"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0 flex-wrap"><span class="font-semibold text-[#9A3412]">89R</span><span class="font-semibold text-[#181715]">HB 3000</span><span title="Passed · Signed" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 border rounded-[2px] font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide leading-none whitespace-nowrap bg-[#F0FDF4] text-[#14532D] border-[#BBF7D0] "><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-[1px] shrink-0 bg-[#14532D]" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>PASSED</span></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>House</span></div><span class="tabular-nums font-medium text-[#181715] shrink-0">IDX 56.1</span></div><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-[#181715] mt-1 leading-snug">Relating to the rural emergency ambulance grant program and county EMS funding.</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#57534E] mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed">Creates a $90 million Texas Comptroller grant program enabling rural counties under 68,750 population to purchase replacement ambulances and retain certified paramedics.</p><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[11px] text-[#78716C] font-mono tabular-nums"><span>Author: King, Ken</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>1 versions</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>1 linked</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>2025-06-18</span></div></button><button type="button" class="w-full p-4 text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer block hover:bg-[#FBF9F5]"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#57534E]"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0 flex-wrap"><span class="font-semibold text-[#9A3412]">88R</span><span class="font-semibold text-[#181715]">SB 2 (88-2)</span><span title="Passed · Signed" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 border rounded-[2px] font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide leading-none whitespace-nowrap bg-[#F0FDF4] text-[#14532D] border-[#BBF7D0] "><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-[1px] shrink-0 bg-[#14532D]" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>PASSED</span></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Senate</span></div><span class="tabular-nums font-medium text-[#181715] shrink-0">IDX 53.0</span></div><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-[#181715] mt-1 leading-snug">Relating to providing property tax relief through school district tax rate compression and a $100,000 homestead exemption.</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#57534E] mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed">Historic $18 billion property tax cut enacted in 2023 compressing school district tax rates by 10.7 cents and raising the homestead exemption from $40,000 to $100,000.</p><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[11px] text-[#78716C] font-mono tabular-nums"><span>Author: Bettencourt</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>0 versions</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>1 linked</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>2023-07-22</span></div></button><button type="button" class="w-full p-4 text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer block hover:bg-[#FBF9F5]"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#57534E]"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0 flex-wrap"><span class="font-semibold text-[#9A3412]">87R</span><span class="font-semibold text-[#181715]">SB 3</span><span title="Passed · Signed" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 border rounded-[2px] font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide leading-none whitespace-nowrap bg-[#F0FDF4] text-[#14532D] border-[#BBF7D0] "><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-[1px] shrink-0 bg-[#14532D]" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>PASSED</span></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Senate</span></div><span class="tabular-nums font-medium text-[#181715] shrink-0">IDX 52.4</span></div><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-[#181715] mt-1 leading-snug">Relating to preparing for, preventing, and responding to weather emergencies and power outages in the ERCOT electric grid.</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#57534E] mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed">Omnibus post-Winter Storm Uri legislation mandating power plant and natural gas weatherization, creating the Texas Energy Reliability Council, and overhauling ERCOT emergency alert notifications.</p><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[11px] text-[#78716C] font-mono tabular-nums"><span>Author: Schwertner</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>0 versions</spa